cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalisation, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the paper it formalises."
type: software
title: "FastDynamo: a Lean 4 formalisation of 'A fast dynamo with zero topological entropy'"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib formalisation of the construction of an
  autonomous Lipschitz fast dynamo on the flat three-torus whose particle flow
  has zero topological entropy.
authors:
  - family-names: Niebel
    given-names: Lukas
    affiliation: "ETH Zürich, Department of Mathematics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lukasniebel/fast_dynamo_lean"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalisation
  - fast dynamo
  - kinematic induction equation
  - topological entropy
references:
  - type: article
    title: "A fast dynamo with zero topological entropy"
    authors:
